.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * set default formatting
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" disable hyphenation
.nh
.\" disable justification (adjust text to left margin only)
.ad l
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * MAIN CONTENT STARTS HERE *
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.SH "نام (NAME)"
egk-tool \- displays information on the German electronic health card (elektronische Gesundheitskarte, eGK)
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBegk\-tool\fR\ 'u
\fBegk\-tool\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The
\fBegk\-tool\fR
utility is used to display information stored on the German elektronic health card (elektronische Gesundheitskarte,
eGK)\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
.PP
\fB\-\-help\fR, \fB\-h\fR
.RS 4
Print help and exit\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-version\fR, \fB\-V\fR
.RS 4
Print version and exit\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-reader\fR \fIarg\fR, \fB\-r\fR \fIarg\fR
.RS 4
Number of the reader to use\&. By default, the first reader with a present card is used\&. If
\fIarg\fR
is an ATR, the reader with a matching card will be chosen\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR, \fB\-v\fR
.RS 4
Causes
\fBegk\-tool\fR
to be more verbose\&. Specify this flag several times to be more verbose\&.
.RE
.SS "\*(AqGesundheitsanwendung\*(Aq, Health Care Application (HCA)"
.PP
\fB\-\-pd\fR
.RS 4
Show \*(AqPersönliche Versichertendaten\*(Aq (XML)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-vd\fR
.RS 4
Show \*(AqAllgemeine Versichertendaten\*(Aq (XML)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-gvd\fR
.RS 4
Show \*(AqGeschützte Versichertendaten\*(Aq (XML)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-vsd\-status\fR
.RS 4
Show \*(AqVersichertenstammdaten\-Status\*(Aq\&.
.RE
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
\fBegk\-tool\fR
was written by Frank Morgner
<frankmorgner@gmail\&.com>\&.
